### IPP-403 Question browsing API tests
### How to use: run `npm run dev` in /server, then click "Send Request" above each request, top to bottom.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Login details (put real passwords here only while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back)
@adminEmail = askedin143@gmail.com
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME
### Any normal (unpaid) verified user
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword =  secret456

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}


### ---- Guest (no login) ----

### 1. PHP questions page 1 -> expect 200, ONLY the first topic (PHP: Basics & Syntax, 4 questions, with answers), total 4, "hiddenCount": 16 (IPP-1607)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php


### 2. Page 2 -> expect 0 questions (guests only get the first topic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&page=2


### 3. Filter by difficulty -> expect only "difficulty": "hard"
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&difficulty=hard


### 4. Search -> expect the "Abstract class vs interface" question (MCQs never appear here)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&search=class


### 5. Tags for the filter dropdown -> expect a list of tags A-Z
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/tags?language=php


### 6. Filter by tag (pick any tag from request 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&tag=oop


### 7. Unknown language -> expect 404 "Language not found"
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=cobol


### 8. Bad limit -> expect 400 "limit must be 1 to 50"
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?limit=500


### 9. One paid question -> put the _id of a NOT free question (Admin -> Questions) in place of QUESTION_ID
###    expect 403, code NEEDS_FULL_ACCESS (IPP-1501)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/6ad895509dcf1f882fd24a20


### ---- Unpaid user ----

### 10. Login as a normal user -> expect 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}"
}


### 11. All PHP questions -> still only the first topic, "hiddenCount": 16, "hasFullAccess": false
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ---- Admin (has full access) ----

### 12. Admin login -> expect 200
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}


### 13. All PHP questions -> 0 locked, every question has an answer, "hasFullAccess": true
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 14. Admin table list (IPP-1003): everything incl. MCQs -> expect total 40
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions?language=php&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 15. Admin filter: only MCQs -> expect total 20, with options and correctOption
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions?type=mcq
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 16. Admin filter: free Q&A -> expect total 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions?type=qa&isFree=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 17. Admin list as a normal user -> expect 403 "Admin access only"
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
